SECTION      | KEY                | VALUE
----------------------------------------
META         | piece_id           | footrace-fu-token
STATE        | menu_stay_open     | 1
STATE        | grab_pointer       | 1
STATE        | grab_keyboard      | 1
METHOD       | New Game                 | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger setup'
METHOD       | Select Ninja 1           | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger select1'
METHOD       | Select Ninja 2           | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger select2'
METHOD       | Select Ninja 3           | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger select3'
METHOD       | Select Ninja 4           | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger select4'
METHOD       | Select Ninja 5           | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger select5'
METHOD       | Move (1d6)               | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger move'
METHOD       | Attack                   | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger attack'
METHOD       | Block                    | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger block'
METHOD       | Cast Time Skip           | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger cast_timeskip'
METHOD       | Cast Warp Ally           | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger cast_warp'
METHOD       | Cast Banish Foe          | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger cast_banish'
METHOD       | Cast Chrono Shield       | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger cast_shield'
METHOD       | Cast Shadow Blink        | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger cast_blink'
METHOD       | End Turn                 | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger endturn'
METHOD       | Close                    | CLOSE
METHOD       | Cancel                   | void
